				1128,
				3
			],
			"Message": "style(Mountain): Compact multi-line statements in build modules\n\nReformat local variable assignments in `LocalhostPlugin.rs` and `WindowBuild.rs` to single lines where they do not exceed width constraints, and align doc comment wrapping in `Scheme.rs` to a consistent column. These changes reduce vertical whitespace in the Tauri binary build logic and URI scheme handler documentation.\n\nThe functional behavior remains unchanged. The modifications improve code density and adhere to the project's compact Rust formatting conventions for simple statements.",
			"SHA": "405ac8261d93cf606442408499abd0c4c58109fe"
		},
